# Raw reference material (real telemetry samples, competitor screenshots) —
# large binaries whose useful content is already distilled into SPEC.md and
# the trimmed test/fixtures/ files. Kept locally, not in git history.
/samples/
/reasearch/

# Rendered screen images from test/goldens/render_screens_test.dart. Not
# committed as regression baselines yet: the Phase 1 screens are still moving,
# and a baseline that gets refreshed on every change is a file that records
# nothing. They become real goldens (§12) alongside the chart core, where
# visual regressions are genuinely hard to catch by eye.
test/goldens/build/
